### GreenSense — 03 · Reading the garden back
#
# Everything the app screens call. Run 00 → 01 → 02 first so there is data to see.

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# HOME SCREEN
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Dashboard — the whole home screen in one call
# Sensor tiles, actuator pills, unread badge, latest soil card, hero counters and the
# recent timeline. Deliberately one round trip: the mobile screen renders all of it at once.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Master switch OFF — the emergency stop
# Suppresses every rule and schedule. Manual commands still work, so the garden stays
# recoverable rather than becoming unreachable.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/system
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enabled": false }

### Master switch back ON
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/system
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enabled": true }

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CHARTS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 24-hour series (60-minute buckets)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/readings/series?type=temperature&range=24H
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7-day series (3-hour buckets)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/readings/series?type=soil-moisture&range=7D
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 30-day series (12-hour buckets)
# Bucket width scales with the range on purpose: a raw 30-day pull at 60 s sampling is
# 43 200 points, which no phone chart wants and no mobile connection should carry.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/readings/series?type=temperature&range=30D
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Custom window
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/readings/series?type=light&from=2026-08-05T00:00:00Z&to=2026-08-12T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Summary — current, min, max, and the "↑ Tăng 2°C so với hôm qua" delta
# `delta` compares this window against the immediately preceding window of equal length.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/readings/summary?type=temperature&range=24H
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Latest value per sensor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/readings/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ACTUATORS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Actuator states
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/actuators
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Start the pump by hand for 5 minutes
# The reply carries the command's correlationId and status. SENT means it reached the
# broker — not that the relay clicked. ACKED, from the device, is the proof.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/actuators/{{pumpId}}/command
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "TURN_ON", "durationMinutes": 5 }

### Stop the pump
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/actuators/{{pumpId}}/command
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "TURN_OFF" }

### Lock the pump to manual — rules can no longer drive it
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/actuators/{{pumpId}}/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "MANUAL" }

### Hand it back to the automation
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/actuators/{{pumpId}}/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "AUTO" }

### Command history — "did the hardware actually hear me?"
# PENDING → SENT → ACKED is the happy path. TIMEOUT means the broker took it but no device
# answered within 30 s, which is how a dead node becomes visible instead of silent.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/commands
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ALERTS & TIMELINE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Bell badge count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/alerts/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Alert inbox
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/alerts?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
    if (response.body.data.items.length > 0) {
        client.global.set("alertId", response.body.data.items[0].id);
    }
%}

### Unread only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/alerts?unreadOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Still-open alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/alerts?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Mark one read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/alerts/{{alertId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Acknowledge — "I have seen this and I am handling it"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/alerts/{{alertId}}/acknowledge
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Mark everything read
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/alerts/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Timeline — "Lịch sử kích hoạt tự động"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/events?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SOIL
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Latest pH with its fertiliser recommendation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/soil/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Enter a pH measured by hand with a test kit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/soil/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ph": 6.2 }

> {%
    client.test("pH 6.2 maps to the slightly-acidic plan", function () {
        client.assert(response.body.data.zone === "SLIGHTLY_ACIDIC");
        client.assert(response.body.data.recommendation.dosage === "200g vôi/m² + 50g NPK/m²");
    });
%}

### Strongly acidic soil gets a different plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/soil/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ph": 4.9 }

### Alkaline soil gets a third plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/soil/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ph": 8.1 }

### The pH reference scale card
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/soil/ph-scale
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### pH history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/soil/history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### "Đánh dấu đã bón phân hôm nay"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/soil/fertilizer
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Bón quanh gốc, tưới nhẹ sau khi bón" }

### Was it marked today?
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/soil/fertilizer/today
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Undo today's mark
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/soil/fertilizer/today
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Fertiliser log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/soil/fertilizer/history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SCHEDULES & EXPORT
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Watering schedules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Water now — overrides the master switch AND the moisture skip
# An explicit human instruction beats both guards; the guards exist to stop the *machine*
# watering pointlessly, not to argue with a person holding a watering can.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/run-now
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Export readings as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/export/readings.csv?type=temperature
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Export readings as JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gardens/{{gardenId}}/export/readings.json?type=soil-moisture
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
